{{Use mdy dates|date=April 2026}}
{{Use American English|date=April 2024}}
'''Group C of the 1994 FIFA World Cup''' was one of six groups of four teams competing at the [[1994 FIFA World Cup|1994 World Cup]] in the United States.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.fifa.com/tournaments/archive/worldcup/usa1994/index.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131220184449/http://www.fifa.com/tournaments/archive/worldcup/usa1994/index.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=December 20, 2013|title=1994 FIFA World Cup USA|publisher=fifa.com|accessdate=July 31, 2014}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/94full.html|title=World Cup 1994|website=[[RSSSF]]|accessdate=July 31, 2014}}</ref> The first match was played June 17, 1994, and the final games took place simultaneously on June 27, 1994.<ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.independent.co.uk/sport/football--world-cup-usa-94-klinsmann-provides-germanys-first-thrust-1423406.html |title=Klinsmann provides Germany's first thrust |date=June 18, 1994 |publisher=The Independent |accessdate=June 14, 2012 |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20121111134443/http://www.independent.co.uk/sport/football--world-cup-usa-94-klinsmann-provides-germanys-first-thrust-1423406.html |archivedate=November 11, 2012 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.independent.co.uk/sport/football--world-cup-usa-94-korean-fightback-unnerves-germans-1425677.html |title=Korean fightback unnerves Germans |date=June 28, 1994 |publisher=The Independent |accessdate=June 14, 2012 |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20121111134506/http://www.independent.co.uk/sport/football--world-cup-usa-94-korean-fightback-unnerves-germans-1425677.html |archivedate=November 11, 2012 |url-status=live}}</ref>

The group consisted of the defending champion [[Germany national football team|Germany]], [[Bolivia national football team|Bolivia]], [[Spain national football team|Spain]], and [[South Korea national football team|South Korea]]. Germany won the group and Spain finished second.<ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.independent.co.uk/sport/football--world-cup-usa-94-caminero-makes-music-for-spain-1425676.html |title=Caminero makes music for Spain |date=June 28, 1994 |publisher=The Independent |accessdate=June 14, 2012 |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20121111134550/http://www.independent.co.uk/sport/football--world-cup-usa-94-caminero-makes-music-for-spain-1425676.html |archivedate=November 11, 2012 |url-status=live}}</ref>

